  "name": {
   "zh": "深度贴图 · Depth Anything 3",
   "en": "Depth Map · Depth Anything 3"
  },
  "intro": {
   "zh": "Depth Anything 3 官方自述：从任意视觉输入预测空间一致的几何；官方称单目深度估计优于 Depth Anything V2。这张卡逐帧交付深度贴图和摄影机，填「已知 焦距」并把「模型」换成 Metric-Large 可得真实尺度。模型选 Large / Giant 时按非商用算。",
   "en": "Depth Anything 3 describes itself as predicting spatially consistent geometry from any visual input; upstream reports monocular depth estimation better than Depth Anything V2. This card delivers a depth map and camera per frame; enter Known Focal Length and set Model to Metric-Large for metric scale. With Model set to Large / Giant, the card counts as non-commercial."
  },
  "author": "Lab2Shot",
  "created": "2026-09-21T16:00:00",
  "deliverable": "depth_image",
  "owner": "admin",
  "updated": "2026-10-03T01:00:00"
 },
